Nodejs,Express.js, MongoDb and Firebase.

% -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Short Explanation
       Firebase → Ready-made backend service (database + auth + storage).
       MongoDB → Only database, aapko backend logic khud banana hota hai.
       Express.js → Node.js me backend banane ka shortcut framework.
       Node.js → Server pe JavaScript run karne ka engine.

Story Example
Socho aap ek restaurant khol rahe ho.

       Node.js → Gas stove (server chalane ka engine).
       Express.js → Chef ka kitchen plan (routes & logic).
       MongoDB → Store room jaha raw materials (data) rakhe hain.
       Firebase → Ready-made catering service jo khana, menu, waiter sab de deta hai — aapko sirf serve karna hai.


